::MCR_U04_L07_Quiz_Q01::
Question ID: MCR_U04_L07_Quiz_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.MCR.FL.2
Question:
Which response best supports this spreadsheet-supported financial skill: calculate revenue?
{
=A. Use revenue, cost, profit, formulas, and constraints to compare options.#Correct. This matches spreadsheet-supported decision making with calculation and interpretation. 
~B. Choose the option with the largest revenue only.#Revenue alone ignores cost and may not show profit. 
~C. Ignore constraints such as time or budget.#Constraints affect which option is reasonable. 
~D. Use a formula without labels or explanation.#Spreadsheet results need labels and context to support decisions.
}
